  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:618011c67d6c7a164569380d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "寻找该前进的道路",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a4d7a2d5fb160184b9cb499300c47b553fb9988ed58302d3ff5f6b14e20db99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:789ba449ed1a5450abfee010",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大树快车荣获了URA奖短距离项目的\n最优秀奖。\n但获选“年度代表赛马娘”的人却是气槽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d86525237329a00b5383d48b0cd48c0040fc46d6ef10c57ce404668c994fdce4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5de4b031349b54211fe3e75",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只是，大树快车并没有气馁。\n她以训练员所信任的脚程为傲，并发出豪语说\n下次一定要当上“年度代表赛马娘”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a551ad3711f6cb90099b1116fca36f23b5f903cbafd1e5d08f9b71ec6407763",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:465125604d69aa6e42f694dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为此，她发誓要赢得所有参加的\nGⅠ竞赛，让更多人见识到\n她的速度及力量有多么惊人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0218c5336cc2506f9dd0e1650d9e017353e9c47118388b6844903037d9fa05fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67db35901054f6f8041bf1c7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……重新下定决心的两人，\n首先要参加决定春季英里王的“安田纪念”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89c552c693ecd9f4a02378c2a1e3f6a19f79a4a1d391ddff698d4dad9c40559c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daadcacfa443df64b7d8252d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "开拓者",
      "source_fingerprint": "865ee04ffd1f7593492f8cc1fb9416062683a9009fe8ae1a301c68f8d28c6fee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4de8e7085468f620e6eecd09",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“英里冠军赛”将近，\n为了当上年度代表赛马娘，\n大树快车必须吸引众人更多的目光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1eb1a5f19076087f0e100c902a2e37edd78ac95faa69f5e8f3bf92b53c4ce6ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba06162fff1e68bef47686e8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这时，大树快车收到了无声铃鹿\n所下的战书。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff6059c1523ae5a22a903638daf50f62411b6c60fad83db5aebc795ae24b8c95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f39de99a34c6160cf7ef6c6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要能和气势如虹的无声铃鹿\n进行一场令人“印象深刻”的比赛并获胜，\n或许就能成为“年度代表赛马娘”了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26ffa2334c2b3ebaed592a22cb9e8deba1bf8450eb5301ae5982166a8cf98f0e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c75d907cbcc368ec04a32438",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "年度代表赛马娘的结果，\n就看这场“英里冠军赛”的胜负了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7520b13ff92edfbaebacfceff4a4d443b5a3870bb07eee47c6cffe5b7f7d427c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2265bfef65036cdb0a834832",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "追赶你的背影",
      "source_fingerprint": "f71bc1022e799e4b77f57363732b87c1a33e872c87d98a79b61d096ad7a0678e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72c5c0451d7101b466a47e59",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了提升赛马娘们的实力而举办的\n夏季集训开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e86676248cc5302e42b36af0d1c907a363577f875b28d6f9fa5f330e2f5faf5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0782420ca792a2c9dce553b4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "白天要进行严格训练，\n晚上要打枕头仗，\n使大树快车不禁表示“集训真是严苛”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a01710562e31622c3ca6e5095e9582cdd68d5bc045e917beb6672b6e816139bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e686860307e406f57214f946",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她夸口要成为第一个出身短距离\n及英里赛的“年度代表赛马娘”，\n自然也不是空口说白话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c11465080ef6a7461adc85c5e745fb4df27beb3e10362c6f21c1f405c590b7d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66fc609fd7afb5e0da5535e1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "充满干劲的她，决定要努力训练及打枕头仗，\n来熬过夏季集训。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b32f59999ead189017ba524b1503951449f3a1f31dcc55346318486cbae46dd6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fe3bca769d0be66af694a19",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第二年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e193ad94ba56712a8e92ed87a15587d1a6af48670f61e354efcb818a0837f0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7e44e8f20dbad639c213c36",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今年也来到这个炎热的季节了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f55fd6a7e947ce4683f9af8f96ba8dd4e21ae212359f9ac8b905854ea110967e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:020f08a784e6026afd4561dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了“短途马锦标”，\n大树快车做好了接受任何训练的心理准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2126b4e706849537bf84f5577050133e13f1285f6b2ea62945dbdb96983ae88f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7abb08ea8fd750783bb4a4f5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是，大树快车就在干劲十足的气势下\n揭开了夏季集训的序幕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de015db9a015da33d779c0cb61460f38012e03dee61966fb7a7db9c0e78b98a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80605e13f9c2b3ee4046d8c6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第三年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef37080660583492caac78b957b8f144bbb2896156162385fc6034f5649e4df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78828a933960c06cd001bb29",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终于到了大树快车的“出道战”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbfd6db5acd229d268edb2f914857c8a5b5676334f114c5ae68850d9505c56f6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fa90d337d9303bf1b03371a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以“年度代表赛马娘”为目标的她，\n活力百倍地前往了赛场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ec9c16eff17d6b32a0480188aa8092bbadadac6218cd870ce27efd41828bb7f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49864203d8a5bcc9c21e81b7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea754365577b70c3247fb413fa7b90388e1e4a185a1da5f6c50ef25fe13c496",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57f5789972c9c23b2e1522c6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终于来到“神赞纪念”当天了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "377b7b18f8f9935dcae79ec52f33265877f71e9a27ca938d46b725366b398752",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80512d370254381061e217e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这场英里赛强敌环伺，\n但大树快车并未就此退缩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6c7d64d0ab9b9952fe01e94b81815a7966fda87d4e2d8c2936b4ce3debe4d07",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdf1c26b9d654827409a9ebb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了当上“年度代表赛马娘”，\n她强而有力地冲向赛场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b94492a4ed73647af1032731922e8add177c79b177422cb4618f1b1c1395f41c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b4e6522103f31ecaf5d7066",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向神赞纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "006f49b27852735206a9eff18ca656ed577fde1e04cc58b0fd687cc9499672e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f756f3f2cdfcb9e8f1c5aea2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "亲眼见到热气腾腾的GⅠ赛场，\n大树快车的内心感到雀跃不已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ef4f70171483f2743498163565e8ffc70b48119fbfa57cb1ce1f2319ab54d97",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9df918f675ba15abcdfee00b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了在大型竞赛跑出好成绩，\n以及……\n享受与强悍赛马娘们之间的胜负──",
