    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d38103b129d15dfc70e6b0ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "准备上场前，\n大树快车满脑子只有奋力奔驰这件事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44566aa427a95de9af6a2f026edb3f8c2a8ed00e080c19f2c213c2d7d2727ad6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78ee1d8750d1adadaa204c50",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不只为了赢过无声铃鹿，\n更重要的是为了当上“年度代表赛马娘”……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5ee4ef6cf46c01e8e37ec9a62734f015fb6786c30d53d67982ea112fa9866f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
