      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43cfb10952f3e95401fcefdb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "观众们之间弥漫着一股不安，\n认为就算是大树快车，\n也很难在这种差劲路况上取胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fc9dc0401685bcb5da9c354335346e2854e2a83a7e52859b43fad16850adc84",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ca4c158269df3273839b2a6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但这时大树快车心中\n仍是怀着不畏风雨的热情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b6211110427542f500e4e914eb8e74d5314812ab7e15325e8bc37f29dbccc7d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9ea010861d7383b44a45494",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哪怕是下雨，都要拿出最棒最强悍的表现，\n让观众感到刺激不已──\n她带着这样的心情面对天气恶劣的竞赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c333fc6d4c33db1951d6926cf12837a477366c27eefc75fd72c9f0ae24ac840",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
