      "uid": "zhcn:d040fa03cef1cadba3a1569a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到了第二场短距离GⅠ竞赛……\n也就是“短途马锦标”当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e2ff337a422ed0fc9f5a8577b2fbb50e8c4207ccdd591ef108a9fbe0ab167ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
