    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24a5573a0c29193c46ab9c76",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大树快车乐在其中地完成“出道战”，\n还展现出了适合短距离及英里赛的资质。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9979103bdd35614dcedce3e0cfa44c986476693e8664283373ba7a56627baa1a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dca218ec8928581262b37ea5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而……光靠短距离和英里赛\n就想成为“年度代表赛马娘”，\n必定会是一条艰辛无比的道路……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b71732a50c4f415bd21325c64ce7695ffa889819fded6249b36b60ca5050d0aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8569e0c4e9f78583cc89b473",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，看到大树快车强而有力的跑法，\n训练员相信她一定能够引发奇迹──",
      "source_fingerprint": "327978c408084a7805cbfb47ba2d036560506d6dee7ac17028b80d73cd5372d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010416.json",
