    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f06d8d1ee735db0b945c3a99",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“神赞纪念”也跑得劲道十足的大树快车，\n掌握到了短跑的诀窍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "437fc69545995d201098b206673fe7be6899949b3e2e52930c4016be61d518ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:063f3ab054d6d2e8fece0fbd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她要乘着这股气势，\n以“年度代表赛马娘”的基本条件……\n“最优秀短距离赛马娘”为目标──",
      "source_fingerprint": "074302078db8e9deed6f3e0595f1a5422bb5c53fb1d90f217f4b9340ca6870e6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
