      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“NHK英里杯”结束后，\n大树快车很高兴自己能让许多人感到开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ee5af0ed4ef30425678ef790eb4c2a3b769a86a04b2b392ba9098967dfc5052",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
